OL,3,GNEWSA'We just want to get home' -
OL,4,Adozens stranded in Tunisia after
OL,5,Acancelled Belfast flight
OL,6,
OL,7,FDozens of people from Northern Ireland
OL,8,Fhave been left stranded in Tunisia
OL,9,Fafter their EasyJet flight back to
OL,10,FBelfast was cancelled and the airline
OL,11,Ftold them it had no other flights
OL,12,Favailable for another 10 days.
OL,14,FA number of people have scrambled for
OL,15,Falternative journeys back to Northern
OL,16,FIreland, with one man saying he has
OL,17,Fspent more than #4,000 to get his
OL,18,Ffamily of five home.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
